<title>USA: Metromail Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Metromail Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.42		    $0.06</p>
<p> Net			  9,318		    1,456</p>
<p> Revs			89,500		   69,839</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company completed its initial public offer on June 19, 1996. It was owned by R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co, whose ownership in Metromail was reduced to 38.4 percent. Q4 EPS on a pro forma basis $0.21.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.62		   $ 0.12</p>
<p> Net			 13,862		    2,735</p>
<p> Revs		     281,445		  237,187</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year EPS is equivalent to $0.90 if, on a pro forma basis, the reduction in interest expense from the debt payoff was reflected as of January 1, 1996. On June 19, 1996, an IPO offering of 13.8 million Metromail shares was completed. Full-year 1995 earnings on the same pro forma basis would have been $0.65/shr.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
